#: ../../source/templates_mintlify.md:68
msgid "Shadows & Depth"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mintlify.md:69
msgid ""
"**Card Shadow** (`rgba(0,0,0,0.03) 0px 2px 4px`): Barely-there ambient "
